mages/knowledge_graph_logo.png?202609072020\",\n2125: \t\t\"subOrganization\": {\n2126: \t\t\t\"@type\": \"Organization\",\n2127: \t\t\t\"name\": \"Apple Support\",\n2128: \t\t\t\"url\": \"https://support.apple.com\",\n2129: \t    \"@id\": \"https://support.apple.com/#organization\"\n2130: \t\t},\n2131: \t\t\"contactPoint\": [\n2132: \t\t\t{\n2133: \t\t\t\t\"@typ\n<truncated 2881 bytes>\n with Apple in person. For 60 days, after a new Apple purchase, you can get a new plan through the settings app on your iPhone, iPad or Mac, or by calling 000800 1009009. Or within 60 days, you can go to an Apple Store to purchase a plan.\"\n2213: \t\t\t\t\t}\n2214: \t\t\t\t},\n2215: \t\t\t\t    \n2216: \t\t\t\t{\n2217: \t\t\t\t\t\"@type\": \"Question\",\n2218: \t\t\t\t\t\"name\": \"Does AppleCare cover accessories?\",\n2219: \t\t\t\t\t\"acceptedAnswer\": {\n2220: \t\t\t\t\t\t\"@type\": \"Answer\",\n2221: \t\t\t\t\t\t\"text\": \"When you protect your iPad with AppleCare+, you’ll get coverage for accidental damage for one Apple Pencil and one Apple‑branded iPad keyboard. AppleCare+ also covers any in-box cables and power adapters that came with your covered Apple product.\"\n2222: \t\t\t\t\t}\n2223: \t\t\t\t},\n2224: \t\t\t\t{\n2225: \t\t\t\t\t\"@type\": \"Question\",\n2226: \t\t\t\t\t\"name\": \"How can I get my device repaired?\",\n2227: \t\t\t\t\t\"acceptedAnswer\": {\n2228: \t\t\t\t\t\t\"@type\": \"Answer\",\n2229: \t\t\t\t\t\t\"text\": \"\n2230: You can get your device repaired a few different ways. You can mail it in using a prepaid shipping label from Apple. Or you can bring it in to an Apple Store or any of the over 5,000 Apple Authorised Service Providers. Start a repair by visiting <a href=https://support.apple.com/en-in/repair?cid=mc-ols-applecare-repair_homepage-marcom-07022025>support.apple.com/en-in/repair</a>, downloading the <a href=https://apps.apple.com/in/app/apple-support/id1130498044?pt=2003&ct=support.products&mt=8>Apple Support App</a> or calling your Apple Sup